            "custom_code": "",
            "title": "Regional Pre-Screening",
            "description": "<p>Using ATC’s climate tools and experience, we help you prioritize regions and counties where the climate is fundamentally suitable for Périgord black truffles, so you and your real estate team are focused on the right region.</p>",
            "label": "",
