            "description": "<p>For specific candidate parcels, we conduct a structured review, which may include climate overlays, topography and drainage analysis, soil testing guidance and interpretation, and red-flag checks around water access and competing vegetation. You will know the scientific feasibility of the parcel before you purchase the land.</p>",
